  "interpretation": "The tape's +200 drift is carried roughly equally by follow-through fills (fill channel ~0.47 of positive drift) and LO repricing (~0.53); cancels push AGAINST the drift. The calibrated sim is short almost entirely on the fill channel (tape +2.5 ticks vs sim +0.1): its continuation orders rarely move the mid because the consumed touch refills before the next child fires \u2014 the mechanism gap is post-fill hit-side depth, i.e. what arrives between the parent's slices.",
